      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SMART EDGE (5) scored her maiden success two back but safely held last time when seventh and beaten 18 lengths at this track over 320m (19.93) last time. Returns to the course where she won her maiden. Key player on best and expected to bounce back. ANOTHER RUSSIAN (2) finished second (19.02) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 8th at Dubbo. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. GOOD GIRL MARLI (1) comes off an average performance last start when seventh at this track over 320m behind Blue Jezebel (19.43) in a Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from her last run. One of the main contenders. CAWBOURNE TIFF (4) cannot be left out over a shorter trip.",
